    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BARRY AUCTIONEERS & VALUERS with joint agents COHLAN DOWNING are delighted to bring to the market \"Instow\" which  presents a rare opportunity to acquire a substantial 7 bedroom detached house (503 sq. m.) occupying a generous 0.25-acre site, ideally positioned in the heart of Douglas, Cork. This impressive home offers excellent space and versatility, making it particularly well suited to growing families, those seeking generous accommodation, or buyers looking for a property with significant potential.\r\n\r\nOne of the property's standout features is its beautifully maintained garden, providing an attractive and private outdoor setting with ample space for entertaining, relaxing and family enjoyment. The generous site is a real asset, offering a wonderful sense of space and tranquillity while remaining within such a convenient and sought-after location.\r\n\r\nThe location is particularly appealing, with Douglas village and its wide range of amenities right on the doorstep. Residents can enjoy an excellent selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, bars, schools, sporting facilities and everyday services, while Cork City centre is also within easy reach. The property benefits from excellent transport links and convenient access to the wider road network, making it an ideal base for both city commuters and families."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Ground floor - \r\nEntrance hall with ceramic tiled floor.\nStaircase to upper floors.\nLift to lower ground floor and upper floors. \n\nDouble doors from hallway leading into lounge room. \n\nGuest toilet and wash hand basin, fully tiled floor and walls and double doors leading through into lounge room. \r\n\r\nLounge room - 8.5m x 4.7m \r\nwith feature fireplace with cast iron insert, French doors out to garden, corniced ceiling, recessed lighting and hardwood flooring.\r\n\r\nGuest bedroom with hardwood flooring - 3.1m x 3.0m \r\nEnsuite shower room with wash hand basin and WC, fully tiled floor and walls.\n\r\n\r\nFamily room - 5.0m x 3.4m \r\nwith hardwood flooring, solid fuel stove, corniced ceiling, sliding doors leading through into kitchen.\r\n\r\nKitchen - 8.1m x 3.7m \r\nwith ceramic tile floor, extensive range of fitted units, stainless steel sink unit, integrated appliances including double oven microwave, gas hob and extractor unit, fridge freezer and dishwasher. Central island unit and French doors to rear garden. \r\n\r\nStudy - 3.2m x 3.3m \r\nwith hardwood flooring and recessed lighting. \nStairs down to lower ground floor.\nBack door and cloak area.\r\n\r\nLower Ground Floor - \r\nLarge open plan space, living area, games area, storage area, kitchenette, WC & hand wash basin and Solid Fuel Stove.\r\n\r\nFirst floor - \r\n\r\n\r\nMain bedroom suite - 7.1m x 3.6m \r\nWalk-in dressing rooms.\nFrench doors off bedroom to balcony area. (5.9 x 2.6)\nFull ensuite bathroom with jacuzzi bath, walk-in shower area, double wash hand basins, WC, heated towel rail, extractor unit, fully tiled floor and walls. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.9m x 3.2m \r\nEnsuite shower room with wash hand basin and WC. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.4m x 4.3m \r\nEnsuite shower room, wash hand basin, WC, fully tiled. \r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 3.6m x 3.5m \r\nEnsuite shower, wash hand basin and WC, fully tiled. \r\n\r\nSecond floor - \r\nLarge open plan landing area (7.5 x 7.7).\r\n\r\nBedroom 5 - 5.2m x 5.5m \r\nwith access to storage space under roof. \r\n\r\nBedroom 6 - 4.2m x 3.3m \r\nEnsuite, carpeted floor, large open space.\n\r\n\r\nOutside - \r\n-\tAmple parking area.\n-\tVery good gardens. \n-\tSauna room and storage shed. \n-\tSite area 0.25 acres approx. \r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Most sought after location.\r\nBuilt in 2004\r\nGreat schools and sports amenities nearby.\r\nGreen rate BER\r\nC. 5,435 Sq ft\r\nCirca 1/4 Acre\r\nWindows are PVC double glazed. \r\nHeating is gas-fired radiators. \r\nTimber frame construction"
      },
